{"path":"keyword/consteval","title":"C++ keyword: consteval (since C++20)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ keyword:</span><code>consteval</code><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/keyword/consteval","section":"keyword","kind":"index","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/consteval\"><code>consteval</code> declaration specifier</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/lambda\"><i>lambda-declarator</i></a> that explicitly specifies the function call to be an immediate function\n</li></ul>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx23\"><td>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/if#Consteval_if\"><code>consteval</code> <code>if</code></a> statement\n</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/if\"><code>if</code> statement</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/if\"><code>if</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/else\"><code>else</code></a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/if#Constexpr_if\"><code>constexpr</code> <code>if</code> statement</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/constexpr\"><code>constexpr</code></a> <small>(<code>constexpr</code> <code>if</code> statement)</small>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/switch\"><code>switch</code> statement</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/case\"><code>case</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/default\"><code>default</code></a> <small>(as the declaration of the default case label)</small>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/switch\"><code>switch</code></a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/goto\"><code>goto</code> statement</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/goto\"><code>goto</code></a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/continue\"><code>continue</code> statement</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/continue\"><code>continue</code></a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/break\"><code>break</code> statement</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/break\"><code>break</code></a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/return\"><code>return</code> statement</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/return\"><code>return</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/co_return\"><code>co_return</code></a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/do\"><code>do-while</code> loop</a> and <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/while\"><code>while</code> loop</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/do\"><code>do</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/while\"><code>while</code></a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/for\"><code>for</code> loop</a> and <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/range-for\">range-based <code>for</code> loop</a>: <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/for\"><code>for</code></a>\n</li></ul>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Usage","id":"Usage"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"keyword","title":"C++ keywords"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"C++ keyword: consteval (since C++20)","children":[{"label":"Usage"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":74,"codeBlockCount":0}
